sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant G as GUI
  participant C as Requester Local Core
  participant S as Colab Server
  participant M as Matrix Synapse
  participant O as Owner Local Core
  participant P as Provider runtime

  G->>C: Send @Agent with selected messages and context refs
  C->>S: Create Agent Request
  S->>S: Check membership, blueprint policy and context access
  S->>M: Emit request event into mapped room
  M-->>C: Incremental room sync

  alt owner approval required
    S->>M: Emit awaiting approval state
    O->>S: Approve request by request id
  end

  alt runtime offline
    S->>M: Emit awaiting runtime state
  end

  O->>S: Claim authorized request with short lease
  S-->>O: Trigger context plus request-bound receipt
  O->>P: Resume conversation-specific provider session
  P->>O: Progress or final summary
  O->>S: Report with request-bound receipt
  S->>M: Emit state/result event with reply relation
  M-->>G: Incremental room sync
